  "findings": [
    "Every pilot-envelope order is sized to at most CAD 20 incl. fees and is rejected by AntiBleedGuard with trade_size_too_small; no order is filled and nothing is relaxed.",
    "AntiBleed's 25 bps net-edge rule is expressed in bps of notional and does not see fixed per-order fees; at CAD 20 a CAD 0.05 fixed fee alone costs 25 bps, doubling the required edge.",
    "The minimum size (50) carries no currency in code (live_micro_pilot_governor labels it UNSPECIFIED); in the governed paper router notionals are in account currency (CAD)."
  ],
